# title: Clock and output
# about: The clock and the master output that every other snippet cables to. Paste this one first.
# port: clock.clock (clock): one pulse per 16th note. clock.div4 is one per beat.
# port: out.l, out.r (audio): the speakers. Every sound snippet already cables to these.
part master "Master" colour #8a8f98
  module clock Tally
  module out Finish volume=0.7 glue=0.3 ceiling=0.8
